      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements The bugaboo has killed a creature within the last round and is adjacent to the creature\n\n---\n\nEffect The bugaboo consumes the creature's soul. The soul is utterly destroyed-nothing short of Wish or a similar effect can restore it to life, and only after the bugaboo has been slain. The bugaboo regains Hit Points equal to double the level of the consumed creature. After devouring six souls within a year, a bugaboo transforms into a bogeyman."
    },
